= Intertwiners to Conformal Blocks

To understand the crossing properties of Virasoro or more general
Kac-Moody (KM) conformal blocks, we need tools for calculating or at
least representing these special functions. The Chiral Vertex Operator
(CVO) construction is a powerful method for doing this.

Modernly, mathematicians may prefer some more abstract construction
(VOA and intertwiners) and CVO are not quite commonly mentioned.
However, for physicist, I think its an important tool for
understanding the structure of conformal blocks and their crossing
properties.

